    ["Delete this character's diary?\n\nEvery diary entry, note, session and interaction it recorded goes, and its road. Your settings, and your other characters' diaries, are kept. This cannot be undone."] = "Delete this character's diary?\n\nEvery diary entry, note, session and interaction it recorded goes, and its road. Your settings, and your other characters' diaries, are kept. This cannot be undone.",
    ["Share one diary between all your characters?\n\nThe interface reloads, and every character then uses the shared diary (empty if they never shared one). Nothing is copied or deleted: each character's own diary stays as it is, for if you switch back."] = "Share one diary between all your characters?\n\nThe interface reloads, and every character then uses the shared diary (empty if they never shared one). Nothing is copied or deleted: each character's own diary stays as it is, for if you switch back.",
    ["Give every character its own diary again?\n\nThe interface reloads, and this character then uses its own diary, empty if it never had one. Nothing is copied or deleted: the shared diary stays as it is, for if you share again."] = "Give every character its own diary again?\n\nThe interface reloads, and this character then uses its own diary, empty if it never had one. Nothing is copied or deleted: the shared diary stays as it is, for if you share again.",
